## Notes & carries

- **Subscription delivery**: the PUBLISH side is now proven live (row 12).
  Actual WebSocket fan-out to onGenerationProgress subscribers is Task 7/11
  territory (needs a ws client). The standing M1-M5 question narrows:
  GenerationEvent's RESULT carries tenantId (arg-matching can work); the
  older M1-M5 mutations' result types still lack it — carried.
- NA sections are seeded, not composed → no SectionComposed event by design
  (they appear in the run summary counts).
- Task 6 contract: FinalizeManual reads all section content JSONs from
  `tenants/<t>/generation/<runId>/sections/` and writes m1 documents.
- Synthetic residue (purge list): tenant-arch-smoke org profile + run
  ae134c91… + 36 sections + 106 ledger rows + S3 prefix + 2 m5.risks rows +
  meter rows. AUDITLOG partition is append-only (hash chain) — purge =
  whole-tenant partition removal, never row deletion.
- Gates at commit: full suite + typecheck exit 0; REAL stage synth exit 0
  for BOTH stacks.
